<!--
   QML card back style "Pirates".

   A skull with a tricorne and a headscarf, bone white on dark brown - the same
   palette as the Pirates table style (data/gfx/qml/table/pirates/), so that
   table, pucks and card back read as one.

   The emblem is a bitmap vectorisation (pirate.svg, 501 KB, 480 paths), reduced
   to motif size for the card - for the procedure see
   ../../cards/discworld/discworlddeckstyle.xml. Here, on a 512x499 drawing
   area: tolerance 1, minimum area 2.5 (half the Discworld values, because the
   drawing area is half as large - the target stays at about 0.27 px tolerance
   in the rendered motif). The result is 501 KB -> 72 KB, 480 -> 383 paths.

   Three peculiarities of this source:
   - The vectorisation comes as a line drawing: 262 of the 480 paths are pure
     seam strokes (a group with fill="none") that merely trace the outlines of
     the filled areas. They are dropped without replacement.
   - The bottommost path covers the whole drawing area (the black ground of the
     sticker motif). It has to go, otherwise a black rectangle sits on top of
     the card gradient.
   - The dark areas of the motif (#020202/#141414) are NOT background but inner
     drawing (eye sockets, shadow areas) and lie on top of the light areas -
     they must not be dropped. They are set to #17100a, i.e. between the two
     stops of the card gradient; that way they merge into the ground instead of
     showing up as a blotch. White becomes #ecdfc4 (bone).

   Motif size: width 465 on the 580x800 card (the inner frame is 528 wide),
   scaled to the bounding box of the motif, not to its drawing area.

   preview.png is backside.svg scaled to 424x561 (the standard size of all card
   back previews) - built with preview/build_card_previews.sh.

   File names are relative to this XML.
-->
<PokerTH>
  <CardBack>
     <StyleDescription value="Pirates (QML/SVG)" /><!-- Shown in the style selection -->
     <StyleMaintainerName value="PokerTH Development Team" />
     <StyleMaintainerEMail value="webmaster@pokerth.net" />
     <StyleCreateDate value="28.07.2026" />
     <PokerTHStyleFileVersion value="1" />
     <Preview value="preview.png" /><!-- Preview image (landscape only - no portrait needed) -->

     <!-- Card back graphic (SVG, scalable to any size) -->
     <Backside value="backside.svg" />
  </CardBack>
</PokerTH>
